      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 174 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Development of Korea)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Since the end of the war in 1953,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "the country began to develop very quickly,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "especially during the 1970’s."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "From then until now, the country has continued to grow rapidly."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "In 1988, Korea hosted the Summer Olympic Games"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and in 2002, the World Cup was held in Korea, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I am very proud of my country"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and what it has accomplished during its long history."
    },
